WEBVTT

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:03.750
Senpai, thank you.

00:00:02.290 --> 00:00:04.360
See you tomorrow!

00:00:03.210 --> 00:00:04.870
Bye-bye.

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:21.350
Unya~

00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:24.670
Haruna-sama. Lookin' sexy as always!

00:00:24.830 --> 00:00:25.200
Huh?

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:25.640
Hawahh!!

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:27.820
No, but really,

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:30.170
you're so attractive.

00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:33.170
Geez~ stop it you guys.

00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:35.140
It's embarrassing.

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:37.500
Thanks for waiting~

00:00:37.690 --> 00:00:39.080
Oh there you are!

00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:43.230
Haruka...

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:44.300
let's do it.

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:45.910
Okay.

00:00:46.270 --> 00:00:47.430
But it's...um...

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:49.480
my first time, so...

00:00:49.990 --> 00:00:52.060
be gentle, please...

00:00:53.130 --> 00:00:55.060
It's my first time too...

00:00:55.390 --> 00:00:56.460
but don't worry...

00:00:56.830 --> 00:00:59.050
we can do it.

00:00:59.970 --> 00:01:00.880
Yuuto-san...

00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:42.870
Give me an update on South America.

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:46.470
("Please put it in...")

00:02:43.020 --> 00:02:43.450
Sir!

00:02:43.690 --> 00:02:45.360
They're doing the best they can...

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:47.360
Idiots! If they resist,

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:49.290
tell them I'll take care of them!

00:02:49.380 --> 00:02:49.950
Sir, yes sir!

00:03:04.320 --> 00:03:05.320
Hm?

00:03:06.750 --> 00:03:07.650
Muhuhu~

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:10.810
Alone together in a room this early in the morning without going out, eh?

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:12.540
Way to go, onee-chan~

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:15.950
We have to find out what they're doing!

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:16.470
Kokukoku.

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:17.560
Shh!! Quiet, now!

00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:19.780
What are you guys doing?

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:20.870
Gikkuu!!!

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:22.210
Hanya wanya hawa!

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:23.170
Aha!

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:24.240
Ahahaha,

00:03:24.480 --> 00:03:25.370
Dad,

00:03:25.490 --> 00:03:26.690
welcome home!

00:03:26.820 --> 00:03:27.640
Well, well~?

00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:30.880
Why is there a tapping device here?

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:33.620
It's not just out of curiosity!

00:03:33.300 --> 00:03:33.780
koku

00:03:33.990 --> 00:03:36.870
It is out of duty as a Nogizaka-Family maid team!

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:35.340
koku koku

00:03:35.850 --> 00:03:36.570
koku

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:37.620
Ha!

00:03:37.830 --> 00:03:39.010
You can't fool me.

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:40.410
What's this~?

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:44.230
There's something going on.

00:03:45.610 --> 00:03:46.070
Oh...

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:49.830
Haruka...

00:03:50.390 --> 00:03:50.990
I'm going in.

00:03:51.560 --> 00:03:52.000
Ah...

00:03:52.390 --> 00:03:52.950
Yuuto-san...

00:03:53.470 --> 00:03:54.270
before you do...

00:03:54.760 --> 00:03:56.110
please...put that on...

00:03:56.720 --> 00:03:57.810
You're right...

00:03:57.780 --> 00:03:58.480
Haaa...

00:03:58.780 --> 00:04:00.710
okay, like this?

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:02.010
Huuu...!?

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:02.480
Ah!

00:04:02.670 --> 00:04:03.400
Ouch!

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:04.520
Are you okay?

00:04:04.690 --> 00:04:06.530
Y-yes. I'm sorry...

00:04:06.460 --> 00:04:07.140
Nnnnn!?

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:09.140
It's my first time...

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:11.840
So do I put it in here...

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:12.780
nn...

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:13.730
Ah! Um...

00:04:14.030 --> 00:04:15.660
if you put it in so deep...

00:04:16.040 --> 00:04:17.660
L-like this...?

00:04:18.010 --> 00:04:18.470
Oh...

00:04:18.810 --> 00:04:20.770
if you could wet it a little more...

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:21.940
I'll try...

00:04:22.310 --> 00:04:22.790
Haruka...

00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:24.030
Yuuto-san...

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:25.250
Eeeeeeeeeee~!!

00:04:25.480 --> 00:04:27.710
I-is-is this!?

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:30.170
Is it? Is it? Is it~!?

00:04:30.530 --> 00:04:31.180
Haruka-sama...

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:33.260
Finally entering adulthood...

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:34.160
horori...

00:04:34.180 --> 00:04:34.780
Hunyu

00:04:34.780 --> 00:04:37.110
Unoowahhhhhhhh!!

00:04:38.680 --> 00:04:39.910
Damn it! Damn it!

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:41.630
Ayase Yuuto!!

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:44.140
I will not tolerate this any longer!

00:04:48.270 --> 00:04:49.470
Look here, fool!

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:50.610
Ayase Yuuto!!

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:54.740
What have you done to my daughter!

00:04:55.490 --> 00:04:55.770
Eh?

00:04:56.390 --> 00:04:56.620
Eh?

00:04:57.160 --> 00:04:57.330
Eh?

00:04:57.750 --> 00:04:58.090
Heh?

00:04:58.220 --> 00:04:58.500
Hu?

00:04:58.620 --> 00:04:58.890
Ho?

00:04:58.960 --> 00:04:59.340
Huh?

00:05:01.020 --> 00:05:02.160
Father?

00:05:02.980 --> 00:05:04.090
Ha-Haruka...

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:05.880
what are you doing?

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:07.000
Let's see...

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:10.120
I'm drawing illustrations with Yuuto-san...?

00:05:10.340 --> 00:05:11.420
Illustrations?

00:05:11.650 --> 00:05:12.130
Yes,

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:15.420
she asked me to help her make something called a doujinshi together.

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:16.200
(doujinshi are self-published works from amateurs and sometimes professionals primarily in the fields of manga and anime.)

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:15.980
But

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:19.030
it's the first time for the both of us,

00:05:19.180 --> 00:05:20.290
so we weren't sure what to do...

00:05:20.570 --> 00:05:20.950
Giggles.

00:05:21.440 --> 00:05:25.120
Yuuto-san even tried to use the ink without putting on a nib.

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:28.690
Haruka was wrong about how to put the nib on the pen too.

00:05:29.190 --> 00:05:32.230
Ahh, please keep that a secret~!

00:05:33.290 --> 00:05:35.650
C-collaborating on doujinshi...

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:38.280
Da-ar-ling?

00:05:38.860 --> 00:05:40.270
G-nyuu!!??

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:43.360
Not only tapping into your daughter's room,

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:49.400
but making a stupid misunderstanding and on top of that, barging into her room like that with a katana...

00:05:49.890 --> 00:05:52.630
seems like you're not doing so well at being a great father.

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:54.040
A-Akiho...

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:56.860
um...th-the tapping wasn't my idea, and...

00:05:56.860 --> 00:05:57.570
Oh really?

00:05:57.780 --> 00:05:59.410
There's no one else here, though?

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:00.240
Eeek!?

00:06:01.680 --> 00:06:02.170
Here,

00:06:02.560 --> 00:06:05.680
why don't we go back to our room and talk about it?

00:06:05.820 --> 00:06:06.910
Y-yes...

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:10.110
What's gotten into my father?

00:06:10.440 --> 00:06:11.210
Dunno.

00:06:11.790 --> 00:06:13.100
Alright, let's keep going.

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:13.770
Okay!

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:17.190
So, please, Yuuto~!

00:06:17.190 --> 00:06:18.850
A doujinshi sales event?

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:21.050
You want me to be a vendor there?

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:21.480
Yeah.

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:23.900
I was asked by a circle I know,

00:06:24.510 --> 00:06:26.870
but I'm busy that day too.

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:28.400
Yuuto, you're going too, right?

00:06:28.660 --> 00:06:31.520
It's the only event for the Nocturne Girl's School Lacrosse Club.

00:06:32.110 --> 00:06:33.690
Don't make things up.

00:06:34.130 --> 00:06:36.350
I don't even know what kind of event that is...

00:06:36.740 --> 00:06:39.300
is it like a small version of Natsu-Comic?

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:40.530
Yeah, yeah. it's like that.

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:41.870
Okay then, thanks!!

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:42.170
Oh, hey!!

00:06:42.660 --> 00:06:43.260
Oh,

00:06:43.560 --> 00:06:46.960
and you can sell something there too if you want to~

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:48.830
like doujinshi or a game...

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:50.040
See ya.

00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:51.620
Oh, hey! Nobunaga!!

00:06:52.270 --> 00:06:54.000
I didn't say I will yet...

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:55.940
eh...uh...

00:06:56.630 --> 00:06:59.310
Th-th-that's great~

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:03.900
A beginner like me can help out a circle~?

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:07.020
I'm glad you're happy...

00:07:07.140 --> 00:07:08.620
I wasn't sure about it myself...

00:07:08.760 --> 00:07:10.970
then, I'll let you know the specifics later...

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:11.850
Hey, Haruka!?

00:07:12.760 --> 00:07:13.010
Hah!

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:14.400
Um, Yuuto-san,

00:07:15.390 --> 00:07:20.070
you said I can enter something too, but then

00:07:20.170 --> 00:07:20.630
um...

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:24.830
can I submit a illustration book of the Nocturne Girl's School Lacrosse Club??

00:07:25.150 --> 00:07:26.600
Uh...um...

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:28.630
(Beware)

00:07:27.910 --> 00:07:28.870
A-actually!

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:32.230
I have some drawings that I've saved from before,

00:07:32.570 --> 00:07:34.670
and it would be so great if people could look at them...

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:36.430
what do you think?

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:39.380
Uh...y-yeah, sounds good.

00:07:39.570 --> 00:07:40.050
Yeah...

00:07:40.490 --> 00:07:42.240
Aw!! Thank you so much!

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:45.440
Then, I'll finish it up by the day of the event!

00:07:45.790 --> 00:07:47.910
Huh? It's not done yet?

00:07:48.520 --> 00:07:51.940
No, I want to make it into something called a copy-book,

00:07:52.440 --> 00:07:54.470
but it doesn't have enough pages for that right now,

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:56.700
and I still have to make the cover page...

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:57.930
I see...

00:07:58.310 --> 00:07:59.710
Oh, is that...

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:01.170
something I can help with?

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:04.130
Eh? Oh, no, no! That's too much!

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:08.090
I'm the one making you come along with me,

00:08:08.490 --> 00:08:10.260
so if it's okay with you, let me help you.

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:11.910
Yuuto-san...

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:14.020
thank you so much!!

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:19.470
Geez~ onii-san, how could you?

00:08:19.960 --> 00:08:22.600
You should've told me you were just drawing in the first place.

00:08:22.830 --> 00:08:24.740
What are you talking about?

00:08:25.240 --> 00:08:26.370
You're the one who made the mistake.

00:08:26.510 --> 00:08:28.150
Aw~geez!! I quit!

00:08:28.340 --> 00:08:28.550
hu?

00:08:29.960 --> 00:08:30.530
Ah...

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:34.210
No matter how many times we try, we won't win!!

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:35.420
Shiino-san!

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:38.310
I'm going back to archery club!

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:41.510
Why don't you guys just keep on doing play-lacrosse!?

00:08:41.660 --> 00:08:42.090
Bye.

00:08:42.520 --> 00:08:43.510
Unyaa!!

00:08:43.560 --> 00:08:45.190
What do you mean, "play-"!?

00:08:45.490 --> 00:08:47.790
Miruka and everyone are taking it seriously!

00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:49.950
Shiino-san!

00:08:50.310 --> 00:08:51.470
You are wrong!

00:08:52.620 --> 00:08:53.570
What was that!?

00:08:56.860 --> 00:09:00.110
We are not playing lacrosse just to win!

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:03.890
There's something much more important thank just winning the game!

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:07.420
...what are you talking about...?

00:09:08.180 --> 00:09:09.060
You're so stupid!

00:09:12.010 --> 00:09:12.670
I'll

00:09:13.520 --> 00:09:14.180
keep on waiting...

00:09:15.670 --> 00:09:17.290
I'll wait until you come back...!

00:09:18.470 --> 00:09:21.580
I really like this scene...!

00:09:22.050 --> 00:09:23.520
Even when Shiino-san quits,

00:09:23.880 --> 00:09:26.680
Haruna-sama believes that she'll come back and waits for her.

00:09:27.240 --> 00:09:28.120
I see...

00:09:28.520 --> 00:09:31.670
but she still really sounds like Haruka...

00:09:32.280 --> 00:09:34.460
Doesn't really matter to me, but you guys are watching the anime so much...

00:09:34.450 --> 00:09:36.310
are you getting any work done?

00:09:37.030 --> 00:09:38.140
...what is this....?

00:09:38.530 --> 00:09:40.680
It's the ex-soccer club member, Miruka-chan.

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:41.620
What!!

00:09:42.500 --> 00:09:43.530
...this is a human...?

00:09:44.030 --> 00:09:45.650
W-what about over here...?

00:09:46.210 --> 00:09:48.310
Kuzuha-san and Nanao-san!

00:09:48.640 --> 00:09:51.360
R-right...and you're going to sell this?

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:52.200
Yes,

00:09:52.610 --> 00:09:55.340
I'll be so happy when everyone sees them.

00:09:57.110 --> 00:09:57.770
Onii-san...

00:09:58.050 --> 00:10:00.780
good luck...? Onii-san is the last hope.

00:10:01.220 --> 00:10:04.110
Yeah. I'll do my best...

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:15.380
Tu, tu, tu...

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:17.000
tada!

00:10:17.180 --> 00:10:18.490
Wh-what?

00:10:18.860 --> 00:10:20.010
...eh, th-this is...!

00:10:20.680 --> 00:10:23.470
What do you think? Isn't this onee-chan from before cute too~?

00:10:23.980 --> 00:10:24.780
Mi-Mika!

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:27.010
You can't show Yuuto-san that!!

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:30.130
Eh~? But onii-san wants to see it.

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:30.680
Look!

00:10:30.680 --> 00:10:32.900
This is me in kindergarten~

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:35.350
And Hazuki-san from high school~...

00:10:35.570 --> 00:10:37.330
And then, and then~...

00:10:37.510 --> 00:10:38.160
Ah!

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:38.970
Oops...

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:42.410
Ah! This is...

00:10:42.920 --> 00:10:44.880
Whoo. That's a precious one.

00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:47.530
D-d-don't look at it!

00:10:47.630 --> 00:10:48.680
I'm embarrassed!

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:49.940
Onii-san?

00:10:50.730 --> 00:10:52.980
I'll make these prints cheaper~?

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:54.030
Eh?

00:10:54.220 --> 00:10:57.690
What do you think? You can't get these anywhere else!

00:10:57.820 --> 00:10:58.970
Mi-Mika!!

00:10:59.260 --> 00:11:00.560
Give them back!!

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:01.490
I can't do that.

00:11:01.360 --> 00:11:02.260
Hey!

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:03.280
Nope!

00:11:02.860 --> 00:11:04.120
Give it back!

00:11:08.860 --> 00:11:12.110
Onii-san, it's almost dinner, but what are you gonna do?

00:11:12.610 --> 00:11:14.450
Oh, is it that late already...?

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:17.880
The two useless workers are waiting at home...

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:20.910
but there's more pages to finish...

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:25.090
Oh no! I'm more than happy you helped me up till now!

00:11:25.440 --> 00:11:27.080
I'll do the rest myself!

00:11:27.560 --> 00:11:28.070
But...

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:31.380
Then! Why don't we just invite them here!?

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:33.660
The two useless workers!

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:35.260
What!?

00:11:36.510 --> 00:11:38.500
Cheers!

00:11:39.430 --> 00:11:43.510
Nogizaka Family, just as expected! You guys have pretty good collection of booze.

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:46.290
Uu~nn. Onee-san's gonna get wasted~

00:11:45.710 --> 00:11:48.280
U~n give me some more...

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:47.190
Ahahaha...

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:51.950
Aww.. pour it all the way up to the rim~

00:11:48.690 --> 00:11:50.790
Ottottotto...

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:57.730
(Ahh...my Chateu Raffit 1916...)

00:11:52.460 --> 00:11:58.130
M-my precious wine collection...

00:11:59.850 --> 00:12:01.180
Pwah!

00:12:01.590 --> 00:12:02.630
Ahaha!

00:12:02.620 --> 00:12:03.710
Delicious!

00:12:04.060 --> 00:12:05.890
I knew this was gonna happen...

00:12:06.170 --> 00:12:09.210
I'm glad onee-sama liked it too.

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:10.680
Hahaha...

00:12:10.820 --> 00:12:13.460
then let's finish up quick and work some more, huh?

00:12:13.650 --> 00:12:15.490
Yes! "Fight!".

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:30.930
(all-nighter...)

00:12:27.380 --> 00:12:28.960
No sleep tonight...

00:12:30.930 --> 00:12:35.980
(complete)

00:12:33.450 --> 00:12:34.420
It's finished!

00:12:42.230 --> 00:12:43.130
Be calm...

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:46.220
I just happened to get two tickets to a movie, so...

00:12:46.580 --> 00:12:48.680
I'm just casually asking Yuuto to come...!

00:12:49.320 --> 00:12:50.390
That's all! ...

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:52.920
yeah, there's nothing more to it...

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:55.710
Uh, um! Yuuto!

00:12:56.340 --> 00:12:57.710
I...I! ...eh!?

00:12:58.160 --> 00:13:00.900
Yuuto left early this morning...

00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:03.850
yaaaaawn~

00:13:04.150 --> 00:13:05.460
Eehhh~!?

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:12.060
Let's go to the Nisemaru and Animekame's talk event.

00:13:12.070 --> 00:13:13.640
Ehh? No way~

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:19.200
(Nocturne Girl's School Lacro... This is D-17a, Arumikanno Ueni Aru Mikan.)

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:19.200
(New Arrival! 100yen)

00:13:19.220 --> 00:13:22.780
Hah. This is all the books Nobunaga left with me.

00:13:23.350 --> 00:13:23.750
...Haruka?

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:24.650
Yes!

00:13:26.260 --> 00:13:27.350
We're all set.

00:13:27.840 --> 00:13:28.160
Yes!

00:13:28.580 --> 00:13:29.710
Kyahhhhh!

00:13:30.940 --> 00:13:32.370
Huhuhuhu...

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:34.600
S-s-s-s-stop, please!

00:13:35.140 --> 00:13:38.060
Don't fight it~ Don't fight it~

00:13:38.430 --> 00:13:42.060
It'll be a shame for the Ayase Family to let a guest leave empy handed.

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:39.520
Eehhh...

00:13:39.640 --> 00:13:41.450
Hiyeehh...

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:44.390
We will make a feast for thou~

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:46.950
Amamiya-sa~n, serve me more~

00:13:47.130 --> 00:13:48.710
then while you're at it,

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:54.930
I'll show you a grown-up woman~

00:13:54.760 --> 00:13:58.360
Ahh! Help me, Yuuto~!!

00:14:05.480 --> 00:14:07.170
Now we just wait for the hall to open...

00:14:07.430 --> 00:14:08.980
Um, before that,

00:14:09.290 --> 00:14:12.060
we have to say hello to the neighboring circles...

00:14:12.470 --> 00:14:16.070
there's a custom to give your own book to them when you do.

00:14:16.300 --> 00:14:17.130
I see.

00:14:17.130 --> 00:14:17.790
Hello,

00:14:18.200 --> 00:14:20.180
we're Alien  & Choco-Parfait.

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:21.120
Ah, yes!

00:14:21.320 --> 00:14:23.240
Best of luck to us both today!

00:14:23.490 --> 00:14:25.140
Oh, th-thanks.

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:30.910
Um, we're Arumikanno Ueni Aru Mikan. Best of luck!

00:14:26.110 --> 00:14:28.970
(Arumikanno Ueni Aru Mikan - means Orange on top of an aluminum can)

00:14:31.160 --> 00:14:32.530
Thank you very much~

00:14:32.840 --> 00:14:34.160
oh, is that book...

00:14:34.270 --> 00:14:34.600
Eh?

00:14:34.750 --> 00:14:36.370
Oh, um... that is... um...

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:40.380
Oo, is that from Episode 8 where Haruna-sama was tormented by a nightmare?

00:14:40.360 --> 00:14:42.020
C-can you tell...?

00:14:40.870 --> 00:14:41.420
Aha!

00:14:42.350 --> 00:14:43.660
Yes, yes, it is!!

00:14:43.890 --> 00:14:45.600
That's my favorite episode!

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:49.250
This is great~ I haven't seen anything as good as this.

00:14:49.270 --> 00:14:51.040
Th-thank you very much!!

00:14:51.670 --> 00:14:54.010
Please, take a look at this one too!

00:14:54.300 --> 00:14:55.150
Thanks!

00:14:55.480 --> 00:14:58.080
Okay, then. Good luck~

00:15:00.450 --> 00:15:02.950
Hah! I'm so happy!

00:15:03.490 --> 00:15:04.620
My Haruna-sama...

00:15:04.990 --> 00:15:06.940
was recognized by her fan.

00:15:07.910 --> 00:15:09.350
...the fan's eyes are amazing...

00:15:09.500 --> 00:15:11.060
Nee~, really, this is amazing.

00:15:11.230 --> 00:15:14.360
The monster from Haruna-sama's nightmare looks so real...

00:15:14.940 --> 00:15:18.060
It's not easy to put a monster on the cover either.

00:15:18.360 --> 00:15:21.020
U~n...it gets scarier and scarier the more you look at it...

00:15:22.040 --> 00:15:24.810
Yuuto-san! I've gained a little confidence in myself!

00:15:25.350 --> 00:15:26.640
Let's do our best today.

00:15:27.120 --> 00:15:28.370
Y-yeah...

00:15:35.300 --> 00:15:37.420
Okay, your change is 500 yen.

00:15:37.900 --> 00:15:39.180
Thank you very much.

00:15:40.050 --> 00:15:41.510
Looks like you've gotten used to it.

00:15:41.850 --> 00:15:42.910
Yes, ehehe...

00:15:42.890 --> 00:15:44.910
being a sales girl is kind of fun.

00:15:45.200 --> 00:15:47.150
I feel like we own a store together.

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:47.990
Yeah.

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:52.110
I wish I could someday actually form a circle with Yuuto-san...

00:15:53.700 --> 00:15:54.200
Yeah...

00:15:54.830 --> 00:15:55.830
that'd be great.

00:16:03.510 --> 00:16:04.530
Aw~aw.

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:06.900
geez~ you guys are so lovey dovey everywhere!

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:09.250
They are so cute together~

00:16:09.660 --> 00:16:10.260
But...

00:16:10.760 --> 00:16:13.790
I'm concerned because Haruka-sama's book hasn't been sold at all yet...

00:16:18.170 --> 00:16:18.690
Oh!

00:16:19.400 --> 00:16:20.000
Uh..ha...

00:16:21.430 --> 00:16:22.100
Aww...

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:26.600
Mmm... this looks pretty bad...

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:34.990
Then shall we give our Haruka-sama a helping hand?

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:36.550
If it's for Haruka-sama...

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:37.690
Yeek!

00:16:38.210 --> 00:16:40.660
Hey! No cosplays here.

00:16:41.530 --> 00:16:43.510
Please return to the cosplay hall.

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:47.240
I'm mortified...

00:16:47.820 --> 00:16:48.680
Onii-san,

00:16:48.930 --> 00:16:49.970
we'll leave it up to you~

00:16:52.710 --> 00:16:55.190
No one's buying any...

00:16:55.560 --> 00:16:56.530
Y-yeah...

00:16:58.150 --> 00:16:59.080
I'm sorry...

00:16:59.630 --> 00:17:02.340
I made Yuuto-san help me so much...

00:17:03.740 --> 00:17:05.410
It's nothing to be sorry about, right?

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:08.850
I asked you to let me help you!

00:17:09.210 --> 00:17:09.790
...but...

00:17:13.540 --> 00:17:14.270
Aw...

00:17:15.150 --> 00:17:15.460
Ah...

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:30.960
Yuuto-san,

00:17:31.410 --> 00:17:32.960
I've grown a little confidence in me!

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:34.710
Let's do our best today.

00:17:36.500 --> 00:17:37.720
Yahoo! Yuuto!

00:17:38.820 --> 00:17:39.940
How's it going?

00:17:40.300 --> 00:17:41.570
Nobunaga...

00:17:41.650 --> 00:17:41.910
oh!

00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:42.930
That's right...

00:17:43.300 --> 00:17:44.150
Nobunaga can...

00:17:44.640 --> 00:17:47.300
Wow, this is the book that Yuuto is selling?

00:17:48.140 --> 00:17:49.720
Hmm, I see.

00:17:49.900 --> 00:17:51.910
W-what do you think so far?

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:55.160
Mmm, to tell you the truth, it still has a long way to go.

00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:57.440
You think so too, huh...?

00:17:57.800 --> 00:18:03.070
But you can really get a sense of how much the author likes the Nocturne Girl's School's Lacrosse Club.

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:04.880
Eh? ...which means?

00:18:05.170 --> 00:18:06.220
Look, like here...

00:18:06.650 --> 00:18:10.600
This is Haruna-sama out of uniform that only comes up in one scene of Episode 15.

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:13.250
You can't draw this if you're not watching it really closely.

00:18:13.530 --> 00:18:15.770
O-oh... I see...

00:18:16.180 --> 00:18:18.640
but it's not selling at all.

00:18:18.840 --> 00:18:19.220
Yuuto.

00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:19.970
Hm!?

00:18:21.190 --> 00:18:21.870
...Nobunaga...?

00:18:22.670 --> 00:18:24.470
Doujinshi is, Yuuto...

00:18:25.090 --> 00:18:27.070
is not meant to be just sold.

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:27.860
Eh?

00:18:28.660 --> 00:18:32.510
The most important thing about it is to enjoy the process of making a book that you like!

00:18:38.950 --> 00:18:39.380
Oh!

00:18:39.700 --> 00:18:42.920
We are not playing lacrosse just to win!

00:18:43.670 --> 00:18:46.800
There's something much more important thank just winning the game!

00:18:48.740 --> 00:18:49.630
I see...

00:18:50.720 --> 00:18:51.690
I see!

00:18:52.130 --> 00:18:53.410
Thank you, Nobunaga!

00:18:53.980 --> 00:18:55.030
Oh, Yuuto!

00:18:56.190 --> 00:19:00.640
Hehe. I knew you had a talent for these type of things.

00:19:03.010 --> 00:19:04.500
Ah, that's right.

00:19:05.350 --> 00:19:06.710
There's something that's more important!

00:19:09.180 --> 00:19:09.890
I'm back!

00:19:10.430 --> 00:19:11.700
Cheer up, Haruka!

00:19:11.930 --> 00:19:12.680
Alright.

00:19:14.050 --> 00:19:15.180
Hello!

00:19:15.540 --> 00:19:17.390
It's Haruna-sama's illustration book!

00:19:17.680 --> 00:19:19.390
One for 100 yen!

00:19:19.640 --> 00:19:21.630
Please come take a look!

00:19:22.200 --> 00:19:23.630
Hello!

00:19:23.750 --> 00:19:25.310
Even if just want to browse, it's fine!

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:27.750
But please buy it if...

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:30.130
Oh, um Yuuto-san! You don't have to do that...!

00:19:28.420 --> 00:19:29.820
...you can! Thank you very much!

00:19:31.030 --> 00:19:32.840
We worked so hard to make this.

00:19:33.050 --> 00:19:36.290
We should try to sell it to as many people as we can!

00:19:36.720 --> 00:19:39.570
Also, there's something more important than the sales...

00:19:40.270 --> 00:19:40.650
right?

00:19:43.230 --> 00:19:44.060
Yuuto-san...

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:48.060
It's Haruna-sama's illustration book!

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:50.750
Please come take a look!

00:19:51.220 --> 00:19:51.960
Yuuto-san...

00:19:54.950 --> 00:19:57.030
P-please come support us!

00:19:57.370 --> 00:19:58.310
Ha-Haruka...!

00:19:58.750 --> 00:20:00.370
It's Haruna-sama's illustration book.

00:20:00.900 --> 00:20:02.340
Please come take a look!

00:20:02.820 --> 00:20:05.160
hehe...it's our own handmade book.

00:20:05.910 --> 00:20:06.960
Let's try together.

00:20:07.830 --> 00:20:09.150
Yeah. You're right...!

00:20:09.850 --> 00:20:11.120
Welcome!

00:20:11.630 --> 00:20:13.700
Please feel free to browse around!

00:20:14.140 --> 00:20:17.010
Please come take a look at Haruna-sama's illustration book!

00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:18.560
Thank you!

00:20:18.880 --> 00:20:21.450
Please, even if you're just browsing!

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:23.010
Thank you very much!

00:20:22.160 --> 00:20:24.370
Hehe!! Onii-san, doing so well.

00:20:24.610 --> 00:20:25.510
Hats off.

00:20:25.710 --> 00:20:28.000
I guess we're not needed here.

00:20:27.780 --> 00:20:28.870
Koku, koku.

00:20:29.110 --> 00:20:30.380
Please come take a look~

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:32.620
Please, come take a look!

00:20:50.690 --> 00:20:51.570
I'd like to get this!

00:20:51.980 --> 00:20:52.930
It's 100 yen, right?

00:20:53.570 --> 00:20:55.980
I really like Episode 8 too.

00:20:58.240 --> 00:20:59.140
Let's see...

00:20:59.440 --> 00:20:59.960
Haruka...

00:21:00.520 --> 00:21:02.100
Y-y-yes! It's 100 yen.

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:03.340
Exact change!

00:21:03.780 --> 00:21:05.260
Th-thank you very much!

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:06.380
Bye~

00:21:06.770 --> 00:21:08.180
Thank you so much!

00:21:09.470 --> 00:21:11.320
We did it! Haru...ka?

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:18.150
Yuuto-san!!

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:18.650
Whoa!

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:21.250
Someone finally bought one!

00:21:25.450 --> 00:21:26.000
Uh...um...

00:21:28.130 --> 00:21:28.890
I'm...

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:29.710
I'm...

00:21:30.620 --> 00:21:31.210
Yuuto-san...

00:21:31.670 --> 00:21:32.360
I'm...

00:21:32.690 --> 00:21:33.480
Haruka...

00:21:35.090 --> 00:21:37.190
It's my first time...

00:21:38.190 --> 00:21:38.970
and...

00:21:39.530 --> 00:21:40.230
Yuuto-san...

00:21:44.550 --> 00:21:47.180
Guji guji guji~

00:21:45.030 --> 00:21:46.410
(Gugugu... damn it...)

00:21:45.530 --> 00:21:46.410
(Get a room...)

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:52.510
I'm happy we were able to sell 3 copies.

00:21:53.310 --> 00:21:53.800
Yeah.

00:21:54.190 --> 00:21:55.360
Good job, Haruka.

00:21:55.580 --> 00:21:56.380
Ehehe...

00:21:56.350 --> 00:21:59.690
I feel like I'm dreaming... it's all thanks to Yuuto-san for being there.

00:22:00.180 --> 00:22:02.460
Nah, it's because Haruka tried hard.

00:22:02.650 --> 00:22:04.540
No! It's because of Yuuto-san!

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:08.140
Yuuto-san really is like a Prince Charming...

00:22:08.800 --> 00:22:11.740
whenever I'm in trouble, you're there to help.

00:22:12.390 --> 00:22:15.680
W-well, I'll...help you anytime...

00:22:15.960 --> 00:22:16.680
with doujinshi!

00:22:17.150 --> 00:22:17.720
So...

00:22:18.490 --> 00:22:19.750
Ah! Y-yes!!

00:22:20.240 --> 00:22:22.230
Let's form a circle together next time!

00:22:29.120 --> 00:22:33.500
Ooooh. These are pretty good boobs.

00:22:32.900 --> 00:22:36.500
Aahhnn. The firmness of growing boobs!

00:22:36.510 --> 00:22:39.100
Sto-plea...stop..ah!

00:22:39.240 --> 00:22:42.700
Yuuto! Hurry, come back!

00:22:43.320 --> 00:22:44.050
Ahhh!

00:24:14.970 --> 00:24:18.100
(Nogizaka Vocabulary Fundamentals)

00:24:16.070 --> 00:24:17.950
Nogizaka Vocabulary Fundamentals~

00:24:18.100 --> 00:24:31.030
(tsundere)

00:24:18.270 --> 00:24:20.610
"Tsundere" is someone who says...

00:24:20.790 --> 00:24:23.560
"I don't like you at all!"

00:24:23.650 --> 00:24:25.540
...in front of people, but when they are all alone...

00:24:25.660 --> 00:24:29.000
"S-sorry about earlier...I actually really like you..."

00:24:29.240 --> 00:24:31.000
...they say something like that.

00:24:31.030 --> 00:24:34.910
(Next: "ah, ouch...")

00:24:31.260 --> 00:24:32.730
By the way, who are you?

00:24:32.870 --> 00:24:34.610
You'll find out if you watch the next show!!

00:24:34.910 --> 00:24:39.990
(See you next week!)
